# Copy this file to .env.local and fill both values in, then restart `npm run dev`
# (Vite only reads env files at startup).
#
# Both come from your Supabase dashboard: Project Settings -> API.
# The anon key is a publishable client key, safe to ship in the browser bundle —
# row-level security is what protects the data. Never put the service_role key
# here; it bypasses RLS entirely and must stay server-side.
#
# Auth: Confirm email must stay ON in Supabase → Authentication → Providers →
# Email. Signup passes emailRedirectTo = https://<your-domain>/login, so also
# allowlist that URL under Authentication → URL Configuration (Site URL +
# Redirect URLs). Free-tier mail is rate-limited (~2/hour) and often lands in
# spam — use Resend on the login screen if the first mail is missing.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://tekzjuuerbozevmznymd.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key
